module github.com/xodeeq/<SERVICE>

// The language version. Kept one line below the toolchain pin so that what the code may use
// and what compiles it are separately visible.
go 1.25

// THE TOOLCHAIN IS PINNED AND BUMPED DELIBERATELY. Without this directive the build uses
// whatever Go happens to be installed, which differs between a developer's machine and the
// runner — the same ambient-satisfaction problem that produced the gate-input outages, one
// layer down. actions/setup-go reads this file, so CI and a local run use the same compiler
// and the pin lives in the repo rather than in a workflow.
toolchain go1.25.1
